WEBVTT

00:06.747 --> 00:07.889
Shatterproof

00:43.983 --> 00:47.686
The temperature drops in the empty room

00:51.368 --> 00:55.051
A digital pulse in the silent gloom

00:57.613 --> 01:00.935
I am watching the screen for a sign of life

01:01.556 --> 01:04.598
Cutting the wire with a sterile knife

01:05.159 --> 01:09.602
Shatterproof behind a glass I'm watching you

01:09.782 --> 01:16.563
move Shatterproof, nothing to break, nothing

01:16.583 --> 01:25.231
to prove Cold to the touch, and perfectly smooth

01:26.993 --> 01:28.074
Shatterproof

01:42.272 --> 01:45.734
The surface is clean and the edges are tight.

01:49.497 --> 01:53.020
I am locking the doors for the rest of the night.

01:56.622 --> 02:01.105
No static, no signal, no interference, just the

02:01.125 --> 02:06.349
absolute zero of my appearance. Shatterproof

02:07.110 --> 02:10.312
behind the glass, I'm watching you move.

02:12.462 --> 02:17.886
Shatterproof Nothing to break Nothing to prove

02:19.547 --> 02:25.171
Cold to the touch And perfectly smooth

02:27.012 --> 02:28.934
Shatterproof

02:32.296 --> 02:36.779
The pressure's rising But the structure will

02:36.899 --> 02:41.242
hold The circuitry freezing

02:44.618 --> 02:46.098
in

03:01.162 --> 03:01.962
the cold.

03:25.162 --> 03:29.266
Shatterproof, behind the glass I'm watching

03:29.346 --> 03:35.470
you move Shatterproof, nothing to break,

03:35.930 --> 03:44.076
nothing to prove Cold to the touch I'm perfectly

03:44.176 --> 03:48.100
smooth, shadow proof.

03:54.086 --> 03:55.687
Perfectly smooth,

04:01.493 --> 04:02.654
shadow proof.

